==Icelandic==

===Noun===
{{is-noun|m|lykils|lyklar}}

# a [[key]]
#: ''Hvar eru '''lyklarnir''' elskan?''
#:: Honey, where are the '''keys'''?
#: ''Ekki gleyma '''lyklunum''' þegar þú ferð út.''
#:: Don't forget the '''keys''' when you go out.
#: ''Ég hef þrjá '''lykla''' og [[tyggjó]] í vasanum.''
#:: I have three '''keys''' and some [[gum]] in my pocket.

